{"text": "Soapy walked east to a quiet street, where an old church stood with soft light shining through a violet window. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Inside, the organist was practicing an anthem for Sunday, and the sweet music drifted out into the night. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Soapy had known that anthem well in the days when his life held a mother, roses, friends, and dreams. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Suddenly a wonderful change came over his soul, and he saw with horror the pit of wasted days and dead hopes. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Feeling a new strength in his heart, Soapy decided to pull himself out of the pit and become a real man again. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> A fur dealer had once offered him a job as a driver, and tomorrow he would go and ask for it. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> If I had a job, I would be somebody in the world, he thought, and his heart filled with hope. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Just then Soapy felt a hand on his arm, and he turned to see the broad face of a policeman. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> What are you doing here, asked the policeman, and when Soapy answered Nothing, he said, Then come along. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Three months on the Island, said the judge in the Police Court the next morning.", "alignment": {"characters": ["S", "o", "a", "p", "y", " ", "w", "a", "l", "k", "e", "d", " ", "e", "a", "s", "t", " ", "t", "o", " ", "a", " ", "q", "u", "i", "e", "t", " ", "s", "t", "r", "e", "e", "t", ",", " ", "w", "h", "e", "r", "e", " ", "a", "n", " ", "o", "l", "d", " ", "c", "h", "u", "r", "c", "h", " ", "s", "t", "o", "o", "d", " ", "w", "i", "t", "h", " ", "s", "o", "f", "t", " ", "l", "i", "g", "h", "t", " ", "s", "h", "i", "n", "i", "n", "g", " ", "t", "h", "r", "o", "u", "g", "h", " ", "a", " ", "v", "i", "o", "l", "e", "t", " ", "w", "i", "n", "d", "o", "w", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "I", "n", "s", "i", "d", "e", ",", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "o",